[[:db/add "2942be53-e9b7-54e9-8211-244e09ff8232" :answer/id #uuid "2942be53-e9b7-54e9-8211-244e09ff8232"] [:db/add "2942be53-e9b7-54e9-8211-244e09ff8232" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2942be53-e9b7-54e9-8211-244e09ff8232" :answer/value "10\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "2942be53-e9b7-54e9-8211-244e09ff8232" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2028ddcb-2790-5d04-b39a-1216b7f388e4" :answer/id #uuid "2028ddcb-2790-5d04-b39a-1216b7f388e4"] [:db/add "2028ddcb-2790-5d04-b39a-1216b7f388e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2028ddcb-2790-5d04-b39a-1216b7f388e4" :answer/value "5\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "2028ddcb-2790-5d04-b39a-1216b7f388e4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "94fc76f3-8b52-575b-b306-4e11d2585f6d" :answer/id #uuid "94fc76f3-8b52-575b-b306-4e11d2585f6d"] [:db/add "94fc76f3-8b52-575b-b306-4e11d2585f6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "94fc76f3-8b52-575b-b306-4e11d2585f6d" :answer/value "17\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "94fc76f3-8b52-575b-b306-4e11d2585f6d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "27d85000-543e-5029-b503-47c7a82d0fe3" :answer/id #uuid "27d85000-543e-5029-b503-47c7a82d0fe3"] [:db/add "27d85000-543e-5029-b503-47c7a82d0fe3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "27d85000-543e-5029-b503-47c7a82d0fe3" :answer/value "3\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "27d85000-543e-5029-b503-47c7a82d0fe3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e45d4629-4dca-599a-870f-e4183f29c374" :answer/id #uuid "e45d4629-4dca-599a-870f-e4183f29c374"] [:db/add "e45d4629-4dca-599a-870f-e4183f29c374" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e45d4629-4dca-599a-870f-e4183f29c374" :answer/value "13\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "e45d4629-4dca-599a-870f-e4183f29c374" :answer/validate] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/id #uuid "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af"] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/choices "2942be53-e9b7-54e9-8211-244e09ff8232"] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/choices "2028ddcb-2790-5d04-b39a-1216b7f388e4"] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/choices "94fc76f3-8b52-575b-b306-4e11d2585f6d"] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/choices "27d85000-543e-5029-b503-47c7a82d0fe3"] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/choices "e45d4629-4dca-599a-870f-e4183f29c374"] [:db/add "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/correct "2942be53-e9b7-54e9-8211-244e09ff8232"] [:db/ensure "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb" :question/id #uuid "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb"] [:db/add "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral DABC with measurements](images/85/859e1b1de8f994f597260f539c60411b175e652084a628e7e196d0236c1b31fe.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $DABC$ is $7\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$. The sides $DA=9\\,\\text{cm}$ and $DC=4\\,\\text{cm}$ meet at $70^\\circ$. What is the area of $\\triangle ABC$, rounded to the **nearest integer**?\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $DAC$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAC}&=\\frac12\\cdot DA\\cdot DC\\cdot\\sin\\angle ADC\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 9\\cdot 4\\cdot\\sin70^\\circ\\\\&\\approx16.914467\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $DABC$ and the missing triangle $ABC$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{ABC}&=A_{DAC}-A_{DABC}\\\\&=18\\sin70^\\circ-7\\\\&\\approx9.914467\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $10\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$."] [:db/add "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb" :question/answer-fields "878e4f79-a205-569f-b2a6-932536f767af"] [:db/ensure "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "f014e895-4b1a-59d5-b6ba-886d028f55cb"] [:db/add "46a2e206-f6cb-50c0-a438-7df8e49082c9" :answer/id #uuid "46a2e206-f6cb-50c0-a438-7df8e49082c9"] [:db/add "46a2e206-f6cb-50c0-a438-7df8e49082c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "46a2e206-f6cb-50c0-a438-7df8e49082c9" :answer/value "17\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "46a2e206-f6cb-50c0-a438-7df8e49082c9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5e155d0b-bff0-5e7f-a42d-0ca7f56ef30b" :answer/id #uuid "5e155d0b-bff0-5e7f-a42d-0ca7f56ef30b"] [:db/add "5e155d0b-bff0-5e7f-a42d-0ca7f56ef30b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5e155d0b-bff0-5e7f-a42d-0ca7f56ef30b" :answer/value "19\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "5e155d0b-bff0-5e7f-a42d-0ca7f56ef30b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3568b15b-1c33-586e-b70a-bfececbbae04" :answer/id #uuid "3568b15b-1c33-586e-b70a-bfececbbae04"] [:db/add "3568b15b-1c33-586e-b70a-bfececbbae04" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3568b15b-1c33-586e-b70a-bfececbbae04" :answer/value "14\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "3568b15b-1c33-586e-b70a-bfececbbae04" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3c83a3be-9d9e-59b5-ab18-784c75d7bc0c" :answer/id #uuid "3c83a3be-9d9e-59b5-ab18-784c75d7bc0c"] [:db/add "3c83a3be-9d9e-59b5-ab18-784c75d7bc0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3c83a3be-9d9e-59b5-ab18-784c75d7bc0c" :answer/value "9\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "3c83a3be-9d9e-59b5-ab18-784c75d7bc0c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9e7ae38c-6a08-5c46-9bf2-5c61002da6ca" :answer/id #uuid "9e7ae38c-6a08-5c46-9bf2-5c61002da6ca"] [:db/add "9e7ae38c-6a08-5c46-9bf2-5c61002da6ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9e7ae38c-6a08-5c46-9bf2-5c61002da6ca" :answer/value "7\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "9e7ae38c-6a08-5c46-9bf2-5c61002da6ca" :answer/validate] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/id #uuid "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425"] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/choices "46a2e206-f6cb-50c0-a438-7df8e49082c9"] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/choices "5e155d0b-bff0-5e7f-a42d-0ca7f56ef30b"] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/choices "3568b15b-1c33-586e-b70a-bfececbbae04"] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/choices "3c83a3be-9d9e-59b5-ab18-784c75d7bc0c"] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/choices "9e7ae38c-6a08-5c46-9bf2-5c61002da6ca"] [:db/add "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/correct "3568b15b-1c33-586e-b70a-bfececbbae04"] [:db/ensure "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718" :question/id #uuid "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718"] [:db/add "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral CDAB with measurements](images/f5/f544bbf3271570f4a237e6dd773955be0c23ce53e4c7ca30dade6fbdf927cf7c.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ is $5\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$. The sides $CD=4\\,\\text{cm}$ and $CB=10\\,\\text{cm}$ meet at $105^\\circ$. What is the area of $\\triangle DAB$, rounded to the **nearest integer**?\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $CDB$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDB}&=\\frac12\\cdot CD\\cdot CB\\cdot\\sin\\angle DCB\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 4\\cdot 10\\cdot\\sin105^\\circ\\\\&\\approx19.318517\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ and the missing triangle $DAB$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAB}&=A_{CDB}-A_{CDAB}\\\\&=20\\sin105^\\circ-5\\\\&\\approx14.318517\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $14\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$."] [:db/add "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718" :question/answer-fields "934bf31b-d3b8-5648-9134-dee6a5120425"] [:db/ensure "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "5c104980-abc1-5c71-9362-2de97d494718"] [:db/add "08295d06-ec34-58e2-8923-cc04c2f1d5db" :answer/id #uuid "08295d06-ec34-58e2-8923-cc04c2f1d5db"] [:db/add "08295d06-ec34-58e2-8923-cc04c2f1d5db" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "08295d06-ec34-58e2-8923-cc04c2f1d5db" :answer/value "4"] [:db/ensure "08295d06-ec34-58e2-8923-cc04c2f1d5db" :answer/validate] [:db/add "97760295-5f47-5cef-92be-56a686a058bb" :answer-field/id #uuid "97760295-5f47-5cef-92be-56a686a058bb"] [:db/add "97760295-5f47-5cef-92be-56a686a058bb" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "97760295-5f47-5cef-92be-56a686a058bb" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "97760295-5f47-5cef-92be-56a686a058bb" :answer-field/choices "08295d06-ec34-58e2-8923-cc04c2f1d5db"] [:db/add "97760295-5f47-5cef-92be-56a686a058bb" :answer-field/correct "08295d06-ec34-58e2-8923-cc04c2f1d5db"] [:db/ensure "97760295-5f47-5cef-92be-56a686a058bb" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713" :question/id #uuid "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713"] [:db/add "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral DABC with measurements](images/e3/e3e3c729c3e4a2f58d36eea64437187ffee71588222a27675a4e3f5026499c40.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $DABC$ is $6\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$. The sides $DA=4\\,\\text{cm}$ and $DC=5\\,\\text{cm}$ meet at $105^\\circ$. The area of $\\triangle ABC$, rounded to the **nearest integer**, is {{field-1}} $\\text{cm}^{2}$.\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $DAC$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAC}&=\\frac12\\cdot DA\\cdot DC\\cdot\\sin\\angle ADC\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 4\\cdot 5\\cdot\\sin105^\\circ\\\\&\\approx9.659258\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $DABC$ and the missing triangle $ABC$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{ABC}&=A_{DAC}-A_{DABC}\\\\&=10\\sin105^\\circ-6\\\\&\\approx3.659258\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $4\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$."] [:db/add "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713" :question/answer-fields "97760295-5f47-5cef-92be-56a686a058bb"] [:db/ensure "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "1723f51e-5bdb-5aa6-9154-dcb161d75713"] [:db/add "94fe0195-e8d3-5159-bfee-64e817951f9d" :answer/id #uuid "94fe0195-e8d3-5159-bfee-64e817951f9d"] [:db/add "94fe0195-e8d3-5159-bfee-64e817951f9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "94fe0195-e8d3-5159-bfee-64e817951f9d" :answer/value "19\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "94fe0195-e8d3-5159-bfee-64e817951f9d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "10573d25-6ac5-5d4c-9cca-e33686ef622c" :answer/id #uuid "10573d25-6ac5-5d4c-9cca-e33686ef622c"] [:db/add "10573d25-6ac5-5d4c-9cca-e33686ef622c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "10573d25-6ac5-5d4c-9cca-e33686ef622c" :answer/value "17\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "10573d25-6ac5-5d4c-9cca-e33686ef622c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ea5e63d9-c640-5fcb-b771-eea4e91af55e" :answer/id #uuid "ea5e63d9-c640-5fcb-b771-eea4e91af55e"] [:db/add "ea5e63d9-c640-5fcb-b771-eea4e91af55e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ea5e63d9-c640-5fcb-b771-eea4e91af55e" :answer/value "5\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "ea5e63d9-c640-5fcb-b771-eea4e91af55e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6606d6f6-7acb-56cb-9467-d8a12c70f48d" :answer/id #uuid "6606d6f6-7acb-56cb-9467-d8a12c70f48d"] [:db/add "6606d6f6-7acb-56cb-9467-d8a12c70f48d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6606d6f6-7acb-56cb-9467-d8a12c70f48d" :answer/value "12\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "6606d6f6-7acb-56cb-9467-d8a12c70f48d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870" :answer/id #uuid "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870"] [:db/add "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870" :answer/value "7\\,\\text{cm}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/id #uuid "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6"] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/choices "94fe0195-e8d3-5159-bfee-64e817951f9d"] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/choices "10573d25-6ac5-5d4c-9cca-e33686ef622c"] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/choices "ea5e63d9-c640-5fcb-b771-eea4e91af55e"] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/choices "6606d6f6-7acb-56cb-9467-d8a12c70f48d"] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/choices "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870"] [:db/add "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/correct "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870"] [:db/ensure "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7" :question/id #uuid "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7"] [:db/add "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral BCDA with measurements](images/b7/b7b9085c5c5cbd4c1a466fa7e70bb83c6616169b5471f4925a445f0721734a8d.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ is $5\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$. The sides $BC=9\\,\\text{cm}$ and $BA=4\\,\\text{cm}$ meet at $42^\\circ$. What is the area of $\\triangle CDA$, rounded to the **nearest integer**?\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $BCA$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{BCA}&=\\frac12\\cdot BC\\cdot BA\\cdot\\sin\\angle CBA\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 9\\cdot 4\\cdot\\sin42^\\circ\\\\&\\approx12.044351\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ and the missing triangle $CDA$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDA}&=A_{BCA}-A_{BCDA}\\\\&=18\\sin42^\\circ-5\\\\&\\approx7.044351\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $7\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$."] [:db/add "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7" :question/answer-fields "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6"] [:db/ensure "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "72bbf711-ed5f-5da6-8f40-7486a7f48bd7"] [:db/add "f6cc21be-1f63-5f98-93fb-6308436c3cc6" :answer/id #uuid "f6cc21be-1f63-5f98-93fb-6308436c3cc6"] [:db/add "f6cc21be-1f63-5f98-93fb-6308436c3cc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f6cc21be-1f63-5f98-93fb-6308436c3cc6" :answer/value "10"] [:db/ensure "f6cc21be-1f63-5f98-93fb-6308436c3cc6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "23da016f-7004-5388-a713-3af3f2e864ad" :answer-field/id #uuid "23da016f-7004-5388-a713-3af3f2e864ad"] [:db/add "23da016f-7004-5388-a713-3af3f2e864ad" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "23da016f-7004-5388-a713-3af3f2e864ad" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "23da016f-7004-5388-a713-3af3f2e864ad" :answer-field/choices "f6cc21be-1f63-5f98-93fb-6308436c3cc6"] [:db/add "23da016f-7004-5388-a713-3af3f2e864ad" :answer-field/correct "f6cc21be-1f63-5f98-93fb-6308436c3cc6"] [:db/ensure "23da016f-7004-5388-a713-3af3f2e864ad" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09" :question/id #uuid "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09"] [:db/add "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral CDAB with measurements](images/1e/1e20144abb107eeb5c452cecfad79159103871bcdd9e96cf3ec60ff461ece80d.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ is $3\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$. The sides $CD=4\\,\\text{cm}$ and $CB=7\\,\\text{cm}$ meet at $66^\\circ$. The area of $\\triangle DAB$, rounded to the **nearest integer**, is {{field-1}} $\\text{cm}^{2}$.\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $CDB$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDB}&=\\frac12\\cdot CD\\cdot CB\\cdot\\sin\\angle DCB\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 4\\cdot 7\\cdot\\sin66^\\circ\\\\&\\approx12.789636\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ and the missing triangle $DAB$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAB}&=A_{CDB}-A_{CDAB}\\\\&=14\\sin66^\\circ-3\\\\&\\approx9.789636\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $10\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$."] [:db/add "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09" :question/answer-fields "23da016f-7004-5388-a713-3af3f2e864ad"] [:db/ensure "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "064a163c-f9e7-522d-9ee5-1e3bc6a8fd09"] [:db/add "294cf963-4271-59fe-b8e7-e22f9946e704" :answer/id #uuid "294cf963-4271-59fe-b8e7-e22f9946e704"] [:db/add "294cf963-4271-59fe-b8e7-e22f9946e704" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "294cf963-4271-59fe-b8e7-e22f9946e704" :answer/value "25"] [:db/ensure "294cf963-4271-59fe-b8e7-e22f9946e704" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d597ccf7-4dab-5551-859d-b0d667590672" :answer-field/id #uuid "d597ccf7-4dab-5551-859d-b0d667590672"] [:db/add "d597ccf7-4dab-5551-859d-b0d667590672" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "d597ccf7-4dab-5551-859d-b0d667590672" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d597ccf7-4dab-5551-859d-b0d667590672" :answer-field/choices "294cf963-4271-59fe-b8e7-e22f9946e704"] [:db/add "d597ccf7-4dab-5551-859d-b0d667590672" :answer-field/correct "294cf963-4271-59fe-b8e7-e22f9946e704"] [:db/ensure "d597ccf7-4dab-5551-859d-b0d667590672" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809" :question/id #uuid "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809"] [:db/add "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral CDAB with measurements](images/00/0032bb8638ce6c2d7f84da559201d315d252d736119c937ffd16bbd509fcd050.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ is $10\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$. The sides $CD=11\\,\\text{cm}$ and $CB=7\\,\\text{cm}$ meet at $66^\\circ$. The area of $\\triangle DAB$, rounded to the **nearest integer**, is {{field-1}} $\\text{cm}^{2}$.\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $CDB$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDB}&=\\frac12\\cdot CD\\cdot CB\\cdot\\sin\\angle DCB\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 11\\cdot 7\\cdot\\sin66^\\circ\\\\&\\approx35.171500\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ and the missing triangle $DAB$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAB}&=A_{CDB}-A_{CDAB}\\\\&=38.5\\sin66^\\circ-10\\\\&\\approx25.171500\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $25\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$."] [:db/add "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809" :question/answer-fields "d597ccf7-4dab-5551-859d-b0d667590672"] [:db/ensure "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "53c54f10-542f-5a84-830e-d6247874e809"] [:db/add "def06130-4a68-5a81-91fb-0bdaf4b2c175" :answer/id #uuid "def06130-4a68-5a81-91fb-0bdaf4b2c175"] [:db/add "def06130-4a68-5a81-91fb-0bdaf4b2c175" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "def06130-4a68-5a81-91fb-0bdaf4b2c175" :answer/value "10\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "def06130-4a68-5a81-91fb-0bdaf4b2c175" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d6c41b8c-051f-5e0f-b3b9-2cb087da7ab8" :answer/id #uuid "d6c41b8c-051f-5e0f-b3b9-2cb087da7ab8"] [:db/add "d6c41b8c-051f-5e0f-b3b9-2cb087da7ab8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d6c41b8c-051f-5e0f-b3b9-2cb087da7ab8" :answer/value "22\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "d6c41b8c-051f-5e0f-b3b9-2cb087da7ab8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2e96fd1c-aa88-5849-8d97-ed09ad58ebb6" :answer/id #uuid "2e96fd1c-aa88-5849-8d97-ed09ad58ebb6"] [:db/add "2e96fd1c-aa88-5849-8d97-ed09ad58ebb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2e96fd1c-aa88-5849-8d97-ed09ad58ebb6" :answer/value "45\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "2e96fd1c-aa88-5849-8d97-ed09ad58ebb6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "efca65c2-e5f2-5466-b5f7-93dacc3a4175" :answer/id #uuid "efca65c2-e5f2-5466-b5f7-93dacc3a4175"] [:db/add "efca65c2-e5f2-5466-b5f7-93dacc3a4175" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "efca65c2-e5f2-5466-b5f7-93dacc3a4175" :answer/value "16\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "efca65c2-e5f2-5466-b5f7-93dacc3a4175" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4888ccfd-023a-514d-8387-d373eda0b1c4" :answer/id #uuid "4888ccfd-023a-514d-8387-d373eda0b1c4"] [:db/add "4888ccfd-023a-514d-8387-d373eda0b1c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4888ccfd-023a-514d-8387-d373eda0b1c4" :answer/value "19\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "4888ccfd-023a-514d-8387-d373eda0b1c4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/id #uuid "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e"] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/choices "def06130-4a68-5a81-91fb-0bdaf4b2c175"] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/choices "d6c41b8c-051f-5e0f-b3b9-2cb087da7ab8"] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/choices "2e96fd1c-aa88-5849-8d97-ed09ad58ebb6"] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/choices "efca65c2-e5f2-5466-b5f7-93dacc3a4175"] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/choices "4888ccfd-023a-514d-8387-d373eda0b1c4"] [:db/add "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/correct "efca65c2-e5f2-5466-b5f7-93dacc3a4175"] [:db/ensure "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f" :question/id #uuid "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f"] [:db/add "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral ABCD with measurements](images/24/24879e3d83941369eeda1d10ef9b82e08d4616af8d5696067eb8ed3748094cce.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $ABCD$ is $6\\,\\text{in}^{2}$. The sides $AB=7\\,\\text{in}$ and $AD=9\\,\\text{in}$ meet at $45^\\circ$. What is the area of $\\triangle BCD$, rounded to the **nearest integer**?\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $ABD$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{ABD}&=\\frac12\\cdot AB\\cdot AD\\cdot\\sin\\angle BAD\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 7\\cdot 9\\cdot\\sin45^\\circ\\\\&\\approx22.273864\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $ABCD$ and the missing triangle $BCD$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{BCD}&=A_{ABD}-A_{ABCD}\\\\&=31.5\\sin45^\\circ-6\\\\&\\approx16.273864\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $16\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."] [:db/add "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f" :question/answer-fields "975fb88b-2898-5c78-90f4-8f5337ce342e"] [:db/ensure "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "76c708a6-b086-5d8f-8ca0-0b6a9dadf76f"] [:db/add "df0f3b97-12fa-5577-b499-7e9137fb6fde" :answer/id #uuid "df0f3b97-12fa-5577-b499-7e9137fb6fde"] [:db/add "df0f3b97-12fa-5577-b499-7e9137fb6fde" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "df0f3b97-12fa-5577-b499-7e9137fb6fde" :answer/value "6\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "df0f3b97-12fa-5577-b499-7e9137fb6fde" :answer/validate] [:db/add "443f4b38-3e4b-597a-91b6-57381dcb62f5" :answer/id #uuid "443f4b38-3e4b-597a-91b6-57381dcb62f5"] [:db/add "443f4b38-3e4b-597a-91b6-57381dcb62f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "443f4b38-3e4b-597a-91b6-57381dcb62f5" :answer/value "14\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "443f4b38-3e4b-597a-91b6-57381dcb62f5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "268a3968-3426-5276-b2ec-4f7bb0fcc124" :answer/id #uuid "268a3968-3426-5276-b2ec-4f7bb0fcc124"] [:db/add "268a3968-3426-5276-b2ec-4f7bb0fcc124" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "268a3968-3426-5276-b2ec-4f7bb0fcc124" :answer/value "12\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "268a3968-3426-5276-b2ec-4f7bb0fcc124" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b95227d8-ce9a-57b4-a6f1-6b26cf45475d" :answer/id #uuid "b95227d8-ce9a-57b4-a6f1-6b26cf45475d"] [:db/add "b95227d8-ce9a-57b4-a6f1-6b26cf45475d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b95227d8-ce9a-57b4-a6f1-6b26cf45475d" :answer/value "28\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "b95227d8-ce9a-57b4-a6f1-6b26cf45475d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0f5412a8-fe6f-5cfd-be3f-5b9fda6f36cb" :answer/id #uuid "0f5412a8-fe6f-5cfd-be3f-5b9fda6f36cb"] [:db/add "0f5412a8-fe6f-5cfd-be3f-5b9fda6f36cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0f5412a8-fe6f-5cfd-be3f-5b9fda6f36cb" :answer/value "10\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "0f5412a8-fe6f-5cfd-be3f-5b9fda6f36cb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/id #uuid "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df"] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/choices "df0f3b97-12fa-5577-b499-7e9137fb6fde"] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/choices "443f4b38-3e4b-597a-91b6-57381dcb62f5"] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/choices "268a3968-3426-5276-b2ec-4f7bb0fcc124"] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/choices "b95227d8-ce9a-57b4-a6f1-6b26cf45475d"] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/choices "0f5412a8-fe6f-5cfd-be3f-5b9fda6f36cb"] [:db/add "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/correct "0f5412a8-fe6f-5cfd-be3f-5b9fda6f36cb"] [:db/ensure "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8" :question/id #uuid "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8"] [:db/add "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral BCDA with measurements](images/b0/b08362b6e0a41d7a1860dcb0e37152640d1262e9270714e8748b3f3ddc3081af.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ is $4\\,\\text{in}^{2}$. The sides $BC=7\\,\\text{in}$ and $BA=5\\,\\text{in}$ meet at $52^\\circ$. What is the area of $\\triangle CDA$, rounded to the **nearest integer**?\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $BCA$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{BCA}&=\\frac12\\cdot BC\\cdot BA\\cdot\\sin\\angle CBA\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 7\\cdot 5\\cdot\\sin52^\\circ\\\\&\\approx13.790188\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ and the missing triangle $CDA$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDA}&=A_{BCA}-A_{BCDA}\\\\&=17.5\\sin52^\\circ-4\\\\&\\approx9.790188\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $10\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."] [:db/add "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8" :question/answer-fields "76736061-6aa1-5504-a874-53dc08d0a1df"] [:db/ensure "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "e15248a8-3ab6-5f77-a9ff-9f9d66e09fb8"] [:db/add "bf7f48e6-87b9-5f36-8cf8-dab22d3d8ea7" :answer/id #uuid "bf7f48e6-87b9-5f36-8cf8-dab22d3d8ea7"] [:db/add "bf7f48e6-87b9-5f36-8cf8-dab22d3d8ea7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bf7f48e6-87b9-5f36-8cf8-dab22d3d8ea7" :answer/value "5\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "bf7f48e6-87b9-5f36-8cf8-dab22d3d8ea7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dc161ed4-f0d0-53c7-8ef6-e3224493fe8f" :answer/id #uuid "dc161ed4-f0d0-53c7-8ef6-e3224493fe8f"] [:db/add "dc161ed4-f0d0-53c7-8ef6-e3224493fe8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dc161ed4-f0d0-53c7-8ef6-e3224493fe8f" :answer/value "3\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "dc161ed4-f0d0-53c7-8ef6-e3224493fe8f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "145c2a76-ad68-5029-9196-465ab774db23" :answer/id #uuid "145c2a76-ad68-5029-9196-465ab774db23"] [:db/add "145c2a76-ad68-5029-9196-465ab774db23" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "145c2a76-ad68-5029-9196-465ab774db23" :answer/value "9\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "145c2a76-ad68-5029-9196-465ab774db23" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d23aa305-7728-5819-bcfc-a697b199cb40" :answer/id #uuid "d23aa305-7728-5819-bcfc-a697b199cb40"] [:db/add "d23aa305-7728-5819-bcfc-a697b199cb40" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d23aa305-7728-5819-bcfc-a697b199cb40" :answer/value "21\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "d23aa305-7728-5819-bcfc-a697b199cb40" :answer/validate] [:db/add "da2757da-98fa-5d30-8a6a-cca3eafd01a9" :answer/id #uuid "da2757da-98fa-5d30-8a6a-cca3eafd01a9"] [:db/add "da2757da-98fa-5d30-8a6a-cca3eafd01a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "da2757da-98fa-5d30-8a6a-cca3eafd01a9" :answer/value "24\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "da2757da-98fa-5d30-8a6a-cca3eafd01a9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/id #uuid "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51"] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/choices "bf7f48e6-87b9-5f36-8cf8-dab22d3d8ea7"] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/choices "dc161ed4-f0d0-53c7-8ef6-e3224493fe8f"] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/choices "145c2a76-ad68-5029-9196-465ab774db23"] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/choices "d23aa305-7728-5819-bcfc-a697b199cb40"] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/choices "da2757da-98fa-5d30-8a6a-cca3eafd01a9"] [:db/add "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/correct "145c2a76-ad68-5029-9196-465ab774db23"] [:db/ensure "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899" :question/id #uuid "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899"] [:db/add "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral CDAB with measurements](images/40/40e1a732a1fa15bb08da6ed21d1df3da4d15b87cef3daf6bdcdd548aa2f303bf.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ is $6\\,\\text{in}^{2}$. The sides $CD=5\\,\\text{in}$ and $CB=9\\,\\text{in}$ meet at $42^\\circ$. What is the area of $\\triangle DAB$, rounded to the **nearest integer**?\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $CDB$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDB}&=\\frac12\\cdot CD\\cdot CB\\cdot\\sin\\angle DCB\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 5\\cdot 9\\cdot\\sin42^\\circ\\\\&\\approx15.055439\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ and the missing triangle $DAB$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAB}&=A_{CDB}-A_{CDAB}\\\\&=22.5\\sin42^\\circ-6\\\\&\\approx9.055439\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $9\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."] [:db/add "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899" :question/answer-fields "1d255caa-37d3-5e91-a1b3-bb10ab76de51"] [:db/ensure "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "e6cd0eda-9ad8-5a52-a131-166d8fbec899"] [:db/add "d2f6923d-7516-5000-8f9e-4cd624f7e6c5" :answer/id #uuid "d2f6923d-7516-5000-8f9e-4cd624f7e6c5"] [:db/add "d2f6923d-7516-5000-8f9e-4cd624f7e6c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d2f6923d-7516-5000-8f9e-4cd624f7e6c5" :answer/value "11"] [:db/ensure "d2f6923d-7516-5000-8f9e-4cd624f7e6c5" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fb74d62c-fc60-5bcb-8d27-40ea7e565769" :answer-field/id #uuid "fb74d62c-fc60-5bcb-8d27-40ea7e565769"] [:db/add "fb74d62c-fc60-5bcb-8d27-40ea7e565769" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "fb74d62c-fc60-5bcb-8d27-40ea7e565769" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "fb74d62c-fc60-5bcb-8d27-40ea7e565769" :answer-field/choices "d2f6923d-7516-5000-8f9e-4cd624f7e6c5"] [:db/add "fb74d62c-fc60-5bcb-8d27-40ea7e565769" :answer-field/correct "d2f6923d-7516-5000-8f9e-4cd624f7e6c5"] [:db/ensure "fb74d62c-fc60-5bcb-8d27-40ea7e565769" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54" :question/id #uuid "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54"] [:db/add "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral ABCD with measurements](images/04/0421bc771a9755ed2c02fc468ee050a8157259c7bdd6501a064ba5afec93e385.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $ABCD$ is $9\\,\\text{in}^{2}$. The sides $AB=9\\,\\text{in}$ and $AD=5\\,\\text{in}$ meet at $117^\\circ$. The area of $\\triangle BCD$, rounded to the **nearest integer**, is {{field-1}} $\\text{in}^{2}$.\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $ABD$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{ABD}&=\\frac12\\cdot AB\\cdot AD\\cdot\\sin\\angle BAD\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 9\\cdot 5\\cdot\\sin117^\\circ\\\\&\\approx20.047647\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $ABCD$ and the missing triangle $BCD$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{BCD}&=A_{ABD}-A_{ABCD}\\\\&=22.5\\sin117^\\circ-9\\\\&\\approx11.047647\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $11\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."] [:db/add "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54" :question/answer-fields "fb74d62c-fc60-5bcb-8d27-40ea7e565769"] [:db/ensure "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "4f4413b1-30fe-59f3-9de6-2c5f8c178c54"] [:db/add "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4" :answer/id #uuid "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4"] [:db/add "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4" :answer/value "8"] [:db/ensure "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf" :answer-field/id #uuid "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf"] [:db/add "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf" :answer-field/key "field-1"] [:db/add "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf" :answer-field/choices "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4"] [:db/add "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf" :answer-field/correct "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4"] [:db/ensure "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52" :question/id #uuid "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52"] [:db/add "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral BCDA with measurements](images/c7/c715f2d6e3221f2061abe962c22fde1c08db8beccb1a5367cce1869aed7c1e3c.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ is $3\\,\\text{in}^{2}$. The sides $BC=7\\,\\text{in}$ and $BA=3.5\\,\\text{in}$ meet at $63^\\circ$. The area of $\\triangle CDA$, rounded to the **nearest integer**, is {{field-1}} $\\text{in}^{2}$.\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $BCA$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{BCA}&=\\frac12\\cdot BC\\cdot BA\\cdot\\sin\\angle CBA\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 7\\cdot 3.5\\cdot\\sin63^\\circ\\\\&\\approx10.914830\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ and the missing triangle $CDA$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDA}&=A_{BCA}-A_{BCDA}\\\\&=12.25\\sin63^\\circ-3\\\\&\\approx7.914830\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $8\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."] [:db/add "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52" :question/answer-fields "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf"] [:db/ensure "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52"] [:db/add "0cfa1cae-fc99-5956-9420-7d7bb2b2f684" :answer/id #uuid "0cfa1cae-fc99-5956-9420-7d7bb2b2f684"] [:db/add "0cfa1cae-fc99-5956-9420-7d7bb2b2f684" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0cfa1cae-fc99-5956-9420-7d7bb2b2f684" :answer/value "15\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "0cfa1cae-fc99-5956-9420-7d7bb2b2f684" :answer/validate] [:db/add "73a9017b-afd4-5f5d-a17a-8631548836ff" :answer/id #uuid "73a9017b-afd4-5f5d-a17a-8631548836ff"] [:db/add "73a9017b-afd4-5f5d-a17a-8631548836ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "73a9017b-afd4-5f5d-a17a-8631548836ff" :answer/value "11\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "73a9017b-afd4-5f5d-a17a-8631548836ff" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fcf0e730-5ea6-5e64-80a1-3a648d1b723d" :answer/id #uuid "fcf0e730-5ea6-5e64-80a1-3a648d1b723d"] [:db/add "fcf0e730-5ea6-5e64-80a1-3a648d1b723d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fcf0e730-5ea6-5e64-80a1-3a648d1b723d" :answer/value "4\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "fcf0e730-5ea6-5e64-80a1-3a648d1b723d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6871a1e8-34ac-5082-a78f-f78b0f51bce8" :answer/id #uuid "6871a1e8-34ac-5082-a78f-f78b0f51bce8"] [:db/add "6871a1e8-34ac-5082-a78f-f78b0f51bce8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] 