 to the **nearest integer**?\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator."] [:db/add "06f7d72a-2f1a-5d42-aa9b-53b77a66e426" :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $CDB$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDB}&=\\frac12\\cdot CD\\cdot CB\\cdot\\sin\\angle DCB\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 3.5\\cdot 9\\cdot\\sin105^\\circ\\\\&\\approx15.213332\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ and the missing triangle $DAB$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAB}&=A_{CDB}-A_{CDAB}\\\\&=15.75\\sin105^\\circ-4\\\\&\\approx11.213332\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $11\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."] [:db/add "06f7d72a-2f1a-5d42-aa9b-53b77a66e426" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "06f7d72a-2f1a-5d42-aa9b-53b77a66e426" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "06f7d72a-2f1a-5d42-aa9b-53b77a66e426" :question/answer-fields "7b7c15fd-eba8-54a9-a17c-5615ee30248a"] [:db/ensure "06f7d72a-2f1a-5d42-aa9b-53b77a66e426" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "06f7d72a-2f1a-5d42-aa9b-53b77a66e426"] [:db/add "05047f70-163c-5d33-8e14-1af3560ef282" :answer/id #uuid "05047f70-163c-5d33-8e14-1af3560ef282"] [:db/add "05047f70-163c-5d33-8e14-1af3560ef282" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "05047f70-163c-5d33-8e14-1af3560ef282" :answer/value "7\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "05047f70-163c-5d33-8e14-1af3560ef282" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8810d092-a8ef-5ed2-a5d5-6d9533090966" :answer/id #uuid "8810d092-a8ef-5ed2-a5d5-6d9533090966"] [:db/add "8810d092-a8ef-5ed2-a5d5-6d9533090966" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8810d092-a8ef-5ed2-a5d5-6d9533090966" :answer/value "19\\,\\text{in}^{2}"] [:db/ensure "8810d092-a8ef-5ed2-a5d5-6d9533090966" :answer/valida