he two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{BCA}&=\\frac12\\cdot BC\\cdot BA\\cdot\\sin\\angle CBA\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 6.5\\cdot 9\\cdot\\sin45^\\circ\\\\&\\approx20.682873\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ and the missing triangle $CDA$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDA}&=A_{BCA}-A_{BCDA}\\\\&=29.25\\sin45^\\circ-5\\\\&\\approx15.682873\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $16\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."] [:db/add "16e509f2-0df9-5e62-a21f-baca9baa168b" :question/requires-calculator true] [:db/add "16e509f2-0df9-5e62-a21f-baca9baa168b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "16e509f2-0df9-5e62-a21f-baca9baa168b" :question/answer-fields "021bd455-4a21-51cd-b51b-ae16c3bace69"] [:db/ensure "16e509f2-0df9-5e62-a21f-baca9baa168b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/questions "16e509f2-0df9-5e62-a21f-baca9baa168b"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "70751622-5036-5e51-bdfa-5382622b61ef"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/df/dfc9c346aa5ffd2d4e03b3c1e1bed5ed888a3a71c1ce99147caf2c3ad15514a4/generator.py"] [:db/add 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186105906 :knowledge-point/validate] [:db/cas 17592186561383 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186561390 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186561393 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186561404 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186561408 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186561409 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186561419 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186561428 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186561437 :question/retired nil true] [:db/cas 17592186719513 :question/retired nil true] [:db